  "_note": [
    "MEASURED LIVE, and the suppression is real: Brand -> Tokens -> color ->",
    "`color-action` -> Ignore. `LintState.suppress()` puts the token id in the",
    "suppressed set, `suppressedCount()` answers 1, and the root then renders the",
    "pill 306:2217 draws. No probe and no planted flag \u2014 the only reason this state",
    "looked unreachable is that the control lives two screens down, in",
    "TokenDetailView, not on the Lint screen.",
    "",
    "WHAT THE BOARD WON:",
    "  the pill is the family's Badge instance (333:2360), not a second pill built",
    "  beside it. The root rendered its own span at `px-2` with `leading-none`",
    "  while `SectionStatusBadge` \u2014 the same component on the board, already",
    "  rendering the Presets and Import/export states \u2014 sat one import away. It is",
    "  now one component with a per-status label, colour and leading, so the four",
    "  Badge instances in this family cannot drift apart again.",
    "  10px inset (was 8) and a 16px line (was `leading-none`, i.e. 12) on every",
    "  instance; 18px on this one, which is the only one the boards lead at 18.",
    "",
    "NOT JOINED \u2014 a Figma frame artifact:",
    "  333:2360 itself. Its properties are right (`yellow/100` fill = --bk-yellow-100,",
    "  `yellow/500` edge = --bk-warning, 10/2 inset, radius full) but the frame",
    "  carries `width: 105px`, and its OWN label does not fit in it: `Warnings",
    "  suppressed` at 12/500 Inter measures 146.9 including the board's own 20px of",
    "  padding. The board clips its own text by 42px. Measured rather than assumed",
    "  \u2014 the pill was joined once and failed exactly there.",
    "  The pill's fill, edge, radius and inset ARE checked, on the two sibling",
    "  instances whose frames carry no width: 333:2356 (brand-presets-draft) and",
    "  333:2358 (brand-starters-applied). One component, so one measurement covers",
    "  all four.",
    "  I333:2360;12:11, the label, IS joined \u2014 12/18 in --color/warning-text.",
    "",
    "  Also not joined: 306:2217 itself (the drawer's edge) and 1691:7402 (the",
    "  preview band's 82px text-metric height). See brand-lint-warnings.json.",
    "",
    "The final `hover` step parks the pointer on the panel title. Without it the",
    "pointer stays where the last click left it \u2014 over the Beginner/Pro toggle \u2014",
    "and the contrast sweep reads a hover state instead of the resting screen.",
    "",
    "CHECK-BOARD-COPY: one lead, `components`, triaged in",
    "brand-lint-warnings.json \u2014 two boards of this chassis disagree about that",
    "label and the code keeps `Component styles`."
  ]
